和 f1。黑方最危险的应着是 Rc1：如果白方 Rxc1 Rxc1+，h2 被 f4 后控制，
王无路可逃，是底线杀。所以白方不能换车，而应该走 Qxd3，既吃掉 d3 通路兵，
又用后保护 d1 车。这样局面可以守住，子力基本相当。 } 33... Rc1 34. Rb1 {
[%emt 0:06:20] [%think 36062] [%out 36470] [%in 2] [%cacheread 0]
[%cachewrite 1876] **Situation:** Black threatens 1...Rxd1#. - The rook on c1
attacks my d1 rook along the first rank. - My queen can't defend d1, because
the d3 pawn blocks the d-file. - Black's queen on f4 covers h2, so my king has
no escape square. **Alternatives I rejected:** - **Qxd3** defends d1, but loses
to ...Bc4, which attacks the queen defending d1. It also loses to ...Rxd1+ Qxd1
Rc1: the queen is pinned and lost. - **g3** and **f3** create an escape square,
but I lose a whole rook. - **Re1** loses at once to ...Rxe1#. **Rf1** loses to
...Rxf1+ Kxf1 Rc1#. **Choice: Rb1.** The rook on b1 attacks c1 and covers d1
through c1. If ...Rxd1+, I recapture Rbxd1. If ...Rxa1, Rxa1 wins material.
This still loses a piece against best play (...Rxb1 Rxb1 Rc1+, or ...d2), but
it gives up the least and keeps my queen active for perpetual-check chances. }
